<title>UK: GOLF-ALFRED DUNHILL CUP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>GOLF-ALFRED DUNHILL CUP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>ST ANDREWS, Scotland 1996-10-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results in the</p>
<p>Alfred Dunhill Cup team golf championship on Sunday (prefix</p>
<p>number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Semifinals</p>
<p>1-United States beat Sweden 2-1</p>
<p>Mark O'Meara 68 beat Peter Hedblom 74</p>
<p>Steve Stricker 70 beat Patrik Sjoland 73</p>
<p>Phil Mickelson 71 lost to Jarmo Sandelin 68</p>
<p>Add semifinals</p>
<p>7-New Zealand beat 3-South Africa 2-1</p>
<p>Grant Waite 74 beat Wayne Westner 74 at 21st hole</p>
<p>Greg Turner 71 beat Retief Goosen 72</p>
<p>Frank Nobilo 72 lost to Ernie Els 69</p>
<p>Final</p>
<p>1-United States beat 7-New Zealand 2-1</p>
<p>O'Meara 72 lost to Nobilo 69</p>
<p>Mickelson 69 beat Turner 72</p>
<p>Stricker 67 beat Waite 73</p>
</text>
